+The [A/C root](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/conjugate/AC.md) supplies both the ethical ruling and the primitive constitution. Its frozen *Respect for Experience* body is preserved by reference; the argument around it carries facticity, dignity, love, right form, intention, entrusted power, apportionment and renewal. [A26](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/arguments/A26-Objective-Internality-Mind-as-Worldhood.md) and [C41](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/concepts/C41-Objective-Internality.md) develop the means; [A34](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/arguments/A34-Idealism-Order-of-Dependence.md) and [C60](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/concepts/C60-Idealism-Order-of-Dependence.md) retain the positive order of dependence and distinguish its ontological, transcendental, epistemic, causal and logical respects.
+
+The whole is recovered through the native recognition-matheme, not imposed as a new triangle: `0 → Ø → X → Ø/X → (0/Ø)/(1/X) → 1 ↺ 0/1`. The medium is first occluded in its identification as subject; the world is discriminated; the medium becomes recognisable as medium; the relations on both sides become available together; recognition affirms their differentiated unity. The complete relational form `(0/1)/(1/0)`, the two Spanda readings, the sixfold and the eight determinations remain distinct operations within this native theorem field. Their original source and protected authorial language govern each local use.
+
+**O:I concerns World and Life.** Its product field discloses six aspects through which a Life carries meaning, articulates events, brings powers to bear, changes, finds itself somewhere and enters wider relation. The parent S and six children S0–S5 develop the already ratified S rows of A/C in one product-family home, `submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/products/`. They add seven developed records to the existing 36 A, 36 A′, 64 C and A/C: **144 shared records once materialised**, not a new census of the publication body. A′ remains the technological face of its A operation. The product family belongs to Episteme; it does not replace the four publication registers.
+
+The accepted authorial commission is recorded in the [September 10 minute](working/pre-manuscript-refinement-2026-09-10/AUTHORIAL-MINUTE.md), with its full [paired-MEF reading](working/pre-manuscript-refinement-2026-09-10/MEF-PRODUCT-READING.md) and [relational-Logos exploration](working/pre-manuscript-refinement-2026-09-10/RELATIONAL-LOGOS-EXPLORATION.md). This plan incorporates those structural decisions as its current body. The earlier plan remains exact provenance at `53202810778122a37973868d873335b82d8d36ca`; its displaced operations retain the destinations specified in §5 below.
