-### §5 · #0 — Mathematics already moves as meaning
+### §5 · #0 / M37 — Central: meaningful continuity
+
+Central holds the intelligible ground a Life carries. Memory has this office because a remembered event can remain related to why it mattered, whose experience it was, what intention it changed and what later inquiry made of it. For a human, commitments, autobiography, projects and inherited meanings remain living ground; for an agent, authored and accumulated sources, project histories and returned work can condition a later act without being mistaken for its present judgment. Continuity involves the preservation of meaning and source relation through change, not merely persistence of bytes.
+
+The whole **L0 Quaternal × L5′ Divine Logos** pair discloses this subject. Why, What, How, Whom/Which/When, Where/Why-for and Why-so/Why-not make a world sayable in its reasons, things, activity, relations, places and returned grounds. Arche, Apokalypsis, Dynamis, Sophia, Parousia and Epi-Logos carry origin, disclosure, potency, understanding, presence and reflective return. Their conjunction explains how what a Life has disclosed and learned can remain intelligibly its ground without freezing its future into its past.
+
+The inherited epistemic triad enters here at whole level: Subjective Immediacy is the knower; Central helps constitute the means of meaningful continuity; the remembered and presently encountered World is what becomes known; Life/Mind contains their relation. Sources, authored positions and derived readings must retain whose meaning they bear. A/C’s facticity and dignity ground why an entrusted record cannot be silently replaced by an agent’s plausible reconstruction. Its renewal office asks how a changed experience can enter continuity without overwriting its origin.
+
+Central therefore gives the later model trace and preference baseline somewhere accountable to return. The source, current interpretation, acceptance and later revision have different offices. Their exact repository and installed-world realization is evidenced from current product sources, not inferred from the name Central. The section passes to Actuation when this carried ground becomes active in an event.
+
+### §5 · #1 / M38 — Actuation: living articulation
+
+Actuation is the event-substance of an internality: perception, thinking, speaking and acting articulate a field into a determination, meet actuality, leave traces and change the conditions of the next event. A model token, a human utterance and a practical act remain distinct events whose relation can be investigated. Authority, delegation and composition are particular organisations of this living articulation; they do not exhaust its subject.
+
